<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73418" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμβρ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rain,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετοπωρινὸν ὀμβρήσαντος Ζηνός</span>
			when the latter rain  of autumn comes, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				415
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.1399
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				79
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>rain</i> or <i>shower down upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαθὸν ὀ. τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.402
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηγὰς γάλακτος ὀ. ἐν μαστοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.397
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				2.33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bedew, wet,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακρύοις λάρνακα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.340
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμβρεῖ: ἀτιμάζει, ὑπερισχύει, αὔξει,
				πιαίνει, πλήθει,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
